    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近李亚鹏爆火后，有知名大V持续质疑李亚鹏的慈善举动，那李亚鹏是真活佛大善人还是只是为了圈钱的作秀行为？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天来深聊一下，你们怎么看？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E6%9D%8E%E4%BA%9A%E9%B9%8F" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E6%9D%8E%E4%BA%9A%E9%B9%8F"><span>#李亚鹏</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E7%8E%8B%E8%8F%B2" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E7%8E%8B%E8%8F%B2"><span>#王菲</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E5%AB%A3%E7%84%B6%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E5%AB%A3%E7%84%B6%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2"><span>#嫣然天使医院</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E5%AB%A3%E7%84%B6%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E4%BC%9A" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E5%AB%A3%E7%84%B6%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E4%BC%9A"><span>#嫣然天使基金会</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E7%BA%A2%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97%E4%BC%9A" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E7%BA%A2%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97%E4%BC%9A"><span>#红十字会</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E5%94%87%E8%85%AD%E8%A3%82" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/%E5%94%87%E8%85%AD%E8%A3%82"><span>#唇腭裂</span></a></p>]]></description>
